F,,&F*F,#!\"$F0F," }}}{EXCHG {PARA 0 "" 0 "" {TEXT -1 90 "We then veri
fy that exp(int(y,x)) is a solution of Lz = 0 for y a root of a Darbou
x curve:" }}{PARA 0 "> " 0 "" {MPLTEXT 1 0 23 "sols := map(solve,C,u);
